      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Did you disable your Page File or have a very small page file? Make sure your page file is at least 32GB if you play VRChat. If you don't mind the space, set it up even higher to 48GB-64GB.\n\nEven if you have physical memory free (like it shows in Task Manager), you still need a page file. I can elaborate on why the page file is important, but I will spare you the details unless you ask.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
