      "value": "Since that I've reinstalled windows because I replaced the SSD, but still had the original, so I recovered the files. Couldn't figure out how to upload files here, it only allows images, but if it's okay, I have some urls.\n\nIt might have been what @{654044f5985022fb0addfa2c|full_name} said, that it had too small pagefile, as I was reducing it to save space on the computer. Btw, please explain, even though I learned a bit about them, nobody explained why can it be required even if I have more than enough system memory.\n\nhttps://storage-00.sandfoxed.dev/018e591c-c5d6-7df2-8f60-a6f3159ae8df/Crash_2023-12-17_012851731/crash.dmp\n\nhttps://storage-00.sandfoxed.dev/018e591c-c5d6-7df2-8f60-a6f3159ae8df/Crash_2023-12-07_203448446/crash.dmp\n\nhttps://storage-00.sandfoxed.dev/018e591c-c5d6-7df2-8f60-a6f3159ae8df/Crash_2023-12-17_022338028/crash.dmp\n\nhttps://storage-00.sandfoxed.dev/018e591c-c5d6-7df2-8f60-a6f3159ae8df/Crash_2023-12-23_205754659/crash.dmp\n\nhttps://storage-00.sandfoxed.dev/018e591c-c5d6-7df2-8f60-a6f3159ae8df/Crash_2023-12-16_072839412/crash.dmp\n\nhttps://storage-00.sandfoxed.dev/018e591c-c5d6-7df2-8f60-a6f3159ae8df/Crash_2023-12-17_003728981/crash.dmp\n\nhttps://storage-00.sandfoxed.dev/018e591c-c5d6-7df2-8f60-a6f3159ae8df/Crash_2023-12-17_001854461/crash.dmp\n\nhttps://storage-00.sandfoxed.dev/018e591c-c5d6-7df2-8f60-a6f3159ae8df/logs/output_log_2023-12-23_22-48-46.txt\n\nhttps://storage-00.sandfoxed.dev/018e591c-c5d6-7df2-8f60-a6f3159ae8df/logs/output_log_2023-12-23_21-47-37.txt\n\nhttps://storage-00.sandfoxed.dev/018e591c-c5d6-7df2-8f60-a6f3159ae8df/logs/output_log_2023-12-23_22-30-53.txt\n\nhttps://storage-00.sandfoxed.dev/018e591c-c5d6-7df2-8f60-a6f3159ae8df/logs/output_log_2023-12-23_22-31-46.txt\n\nhttps://storage-00.sandfoxed.dev/018e591c-c5d6-7df2-8f60-a6f3159ae8df/logs/output_log_2023-12-23_22-15-49.txt\n\nhttps://storage-00.sandfoxed.dev/018e591c-c5d6-7df2-8f60-a6f3159ae8df/logs/output_log_2023-12-23_21-52-02.txt",
